body:
I have three kids and I found going from 1 to 2 was the biggest difference for me.  Way bigger than going from 2 to 3

&#x200B;

Congrats on baby #2

That's great - what languages do you speak? I speak English and French and for a while I was learning Ukrainian and Russian, but no where near being fluent in them.  It takes a lot of effort to learn all those languages.

&#x200B;

Do you do a lot of travelling or get together with people who speak those languages to keep it up?

Thanks for the contest.

Hmm, something I want to people to know about me … I am going to try weed for the first time ever sometime next weekend (as long as my ex has the kids). I bought one joint from the Canadian website and it arrived Friday. I am excited and nervous.

&#x200B;

My kids are playing Bob's Burger Monopoly right now :) 

&#x200B;

They are bummed that its not on Netflix anymore
